{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36775","headline":"送杨链师却归贞浩岩 · 罗隐","name":"送杨链师却归贞浩岩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宦途不复更经营，归去东南任意行。\n别後几回思会面，到来相见似前生。\n久居竹盖知勤苦，旧业莲峰想变更。\n爲谢佯狂吴道士，耳中时有铁船声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}